title: '[frame-support] Add fungible metadata traits and ItemOf support'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds a `fungible::metadata` module with `Inspect` and `Mutate` traits for fungible token
    metadata (name, symbol, decimals), mirroring the existing `fungibles::metadata` API.

    This module initially exists to support metadata functionality in the `ItemOf` adapter for
    `fungibles`. When a `fungibles` implementation provides `fungibles::metadata::Inspect` and
    `fungibles::metadata::Mutate`, the corresponding `ItemOf` wrapper now implements
    `fungible::metadata::Inspect` and `fungible::metadata::Mutate`, allowing a single asset from
    a fungibles set to be used where fungible metadata is expected.
crates:
- name: frame-support
  bump: minor
